pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: nav-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: nav-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 0, 400, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$white"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>04 实现该方案的挑战</p>
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 55, 900, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>挑战四：Pointer string 容易 过度声称</strong></p>
  - elementId: left-card-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 110, 560, 280]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [6000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$light"
  - elementId: left-card-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 120, 520, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$danger"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>硬件捕获到的是有限字节片段</strong></p>
  - elementId: left-card-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 155, 520, 225]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>ARG_MEM 只给用户指针附近有限字节</p>
        <p>不是完整内存转储</p>
        <p>不是完整路径字符串</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px">如果直接说"硬件恢复了完整路径名"</p>
        <p>→ 这就是 <strong>过度声称</strong></p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px">截断前缀 是硬件产物</p>
        <p>Full string 是外部产物</p>
        <p>必须严格区分</p>
  - elementId: right-card-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [640, 110, 580, 280]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [6000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$light"
  - elementId: right-card-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [660, 120, 540, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>当前 Artifact 数据</strong></p>
  - elementId: right-card-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [660, 155, 540, 225]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>hardware_pointer_prefix_summary.json：</p>
        <p>• 30 个 BRAM pointer-snapshot repetitions</p>
        <p>• 51 个 pointer groups</p>
        <p>• 1156 captured bytes</p>
        <p>• hardware_pointer_strings_claimed = false</p>
        <p>• full_string_claimed = false</p>
        <p style="margin-top:6px"><strong>正确表述</strong>：</p>
        <p>硬件支持的是 <strong>截断前缀 bytes</strong></p>
        <p>不是 <strong>full path string</strong></p>
  - elementId: bottom-table
    elementType: table
    bounds: [60, 410, 1160, 200]
    columnWidths: [0.25, 0.35, 0.4]
    rowHeights: [0.15, 0.17, 0.17, 0.17, 0.17, 0.17]
    style: "$default"
    rows:
      - - content: {text: "约束"}
        - content: {text: "说明"}
        - content: {text: "边界"}
      - - content: {text: "只选特定 syscall"}
        - content: {text: "openat / write / execve 的指针参数"}
        - content: {text: "不是所有 syscall"}
      - - content: {text: "只读 user 空间"}
        - content: {text: "不读 kernel address"}
        - content: {text: "user pointer 有效"}
      - - content: {text: "有长度限制"}
        - content: {text: "MAX_POINTER_SNAPSHOT_BYTES"}
        - content: {text: "bounded fragments"}
      - - content: {text: "有时间限制"}
        - content: {text: "MAX_POINTER_WATCH_CYCLES"}
        - content: {text: "窗口内"}
      - - content: {text: "遇 NUL 终止"}
        - content: {text: "字符串结束符自动停止"}
        - content: {text: "prefix 不是完整"}
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 680, 400, 30]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>RV-MalTrace 深度技术汇报</p>
  - elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1180, 680, 60, 30]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>21</p>
